  "releaseNotes": "# Release Notes\n\n## 2.9.2\n\n### Added\n\n- add generic `FromJson` method (0938cbe)\n- add property `MetadataFilter` (c8fdcfe)\n- add properties `ImageOutputOptions` and `PersonGeneration` (b1c4b9a)\n- add properties `AudioTimestamp`, `ModelSelectionConfig` and `RoutingConfig` (faa1cca)\n- add property `DisplayName` to `Blob` (0b1e40f)\n- add values are `1K`, `2K`, `4K` (977b88b)\n- add value for Vertex AI (7c55f56)\n- add properties for Vertex AI (20798e1)\n- feat: add sample for ResponseSchema with XML documentation (6bf6b60)\n- Merge pull request #128 from mscraftsman/feature/upgrade-nuget-packages (1ea269d)\n- Merge pull request #126 from mscraftsman/issue/120/add-schema-xmldoc-sample (038253d)\n- add issue template (2cb7afa)\n- add dropdown (af4ee5e)\n- add no response reminder (f7136d3)\n- add namespace explicitly (60ace6b)\n- add Logging (ee116e3)\n- enable IDX features (216c8fa)\n\n### Changed\n\n- update XML documentation (b2fbae9)\n- update data types from discovery doc (ecff5ef)\n- change property to List<> (e272df2)\n- remove property `FunctionCall` (0d269bc)\n- change to .NET 10 (33b6933)\n- upgrade NuGet packages (86dc247)\n- upgrade NuGet packages (0a6cd2c)\n- feat: Upgrade NuGet packages in samples projects (881ced7)\n- upgrade NIX to .NET 10 (878f96c)\n- improve GitHub action (0f34e0b)\n- extend README (bd00fce)\n- rename template (39485b3)\n- improve wording (14b038d)\n- remove title (a00df65)\n- improve template (9a9b164)\n- improve CI trigger (f593db8)\n- improve NIX environment (d10f7fd)\n- fix validation errors (c12cf16)\n- use .NET 10.0 (5d543f3)\n- use .NET 10.0 (7b15853)\n- disable CA1712 (6a269a5)\n- exclude Python venv (d98139c)\n\n## Changelog\n\nChanges across all versions have been documented in the [Changelog](CHANGELOG.md).",
